{
  "_documentation": {
    "purpose": "Source of truth for in-repo labs and crackmes: plan order, prerequisites, techniques trained, check type and platform. Plan: docs/lab_plan.md.",
    "used_by": "Tools_and_Scripts/build_games_json.py, Tools_and_Scripts/validate_games.py",
    "rules": [
      "status 'built' <=> the lab has a row in the README Dojo table and its source exists; tier / difficulty must match that row.",
      "prereqs of a built lab must all be built. Map edges come from prereqs (no more implicit LabN -> LabN-1 chain).",
      "trains: technique ids from dojo_schema.TECHNIQUES. Game -> lab recommendations: per technique, the two lowest-difficulty BUILT labs that train it.",
      "check: quest (existing labs, manual), flag (prints FLAG{...}), checker (checker.py validates an artifact), selftest (CTest harness).",
      "platform.windows_only / needs_unity are shown on the map tile."
    ]
  },
